<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Defining Potential</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: #ffffff;
    width: 1024px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .top-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 25px 40px 10px 0;
    position: relative;
  }
  .title-accent {
    width: 14px;
    height: 70px;
    background: #c0392b;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 15px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .title-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #3a3a3a;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .logo {
    text-align: right;
  }
  .logo-icon {
    color: #c0392b;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }
  .logo-text {
    font-size: 30px;
    color: #333;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: -5px;
  }

  .content-area {
    position: relative;
    padding: 15px 40px 40px 40px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 250px);
    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 190px);
    gap: 25px;
    width: 800px;
  }

  .box {
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 15px 18px;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .box h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .box p {
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 3px 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ability { background: #e2d3e0; border: 1px solid #b89bb5; }
  .ability h2 { color: #6a4a76; }
  .ability p { color: #5a4a5a; }

  .track { background: #a5a5a5; }
  .track h2 { color: #f0f0f0; }
  .track p { color: #f5f5f5; }

  .engagement { background: #a08bab; }
  .engagement h2 { color: #ffffff; }
  .engagement p { color: #f0e8f5; }

  .attributes { background: #2f7ab5; }
  .attributes h2 { color: #ffffff; }
  .attributes p { color: #eaf2fa; }

  .behaviour { background: #7aab3f; }
  .behaviour h2 { color: #ffffff; }
  .behaviour p { color: #eef7e2; }

  .aspiration { background: #c0392b; }
  .aspiration h2 { color: #ffffff; }
  .aspiration p { color: #f8e6e3; }

  .placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    right: 20px;
    top: 200px;
    width: 190px;
    height: 400px;
    border: 1px dashed #bbb;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #999;
    background: #fafafa;
    padding: 10px;
  }

  .bottom-bar {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 8px;
    background: #c0392b;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="top-bar">
    <div class="title-wrap">
      <span class="title-accent"></span>
      <h1>Defining Potential</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="logo">
      <div class="logo-icon">&#9650;&#9650;</div>
      <div class="logo-text">Catalyst</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-area">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="box ability">
        <h2>ABILITY</h2>
        <p>Mental/cognitive ability</p>
        <p>Emotional intelligence</p>
        <p>Technical/functional skills,</p>
        <p>Interpersonal skills, ability to</p>
        <p>stretch and progress quickly</p>
      </div>
      <div class="box track">
        <h2>TRACK RECORD</h2>
        <p>Consistent history of good to</p>
        <p>exceptional performance and</p>
        <p>results</p>
        <p>Good relationships</p>
        <p>and reputation</p>
      </div>
      <div class="box engagement">
        <h2>ENGAGEMENT</h2>
        <p>Emotional commitment</p>
        <p>Rational commitment</p>
        <p>Intent to stay</p>
      </div>
      <div class="box attributes">
        <h2>ATTRIBUTES</h2>
        <p>Innate characteristics</p>
        <p>Energy, drive, passion</p>
        <p>Curiosity, willingness to learn &amp;</p>
        <p>change, Resilience</p>
      </div>
      <div class="box behaviour">
        <h2>BEHAVIOUR</h2>
        <p>Leadership behaviour</p>
        <p>Team player</p>
        <p>Relationship builder</p>
        <p>Contributor</p>
        <p>Values alignment</p>
        <p>Positive Attitude</p>
      </div>
      <div class="box aspiration">
        <h2>ASPIRATION</h2>
        <p>Desire for advancement,</p>
        <p>influence, financial rewards</p>
        <p>Work-life balance</p>
        <p>Overall job satisfaction</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="placeholder">[Photo: woman celebrating with arms raised, sitting cross-legged with laptop, right side of slide]</div>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-bar"></div>

</body>
</html>
